OL,3,AIs there any more snow on the way?
OL,4,
OL,5,FSnow fell across parts of Northern
OL,6,FEngland and southern Scotland on
OL,7,FTuesday, following the first widespread
OL,8,FMet Office weather warning for snow of
OL,9,Fthe season.
OL,11,FAround 1-3cm fell for most locations,
OL,12,Fwhich threatened to cause travel
OL,13,Fdisruption for some major routes.
OL,15,FBut with milder air spreading in across
OL,16,Fthe UK, and the ground still relatively
OL,17,Fwarm at this time of year, much of that
OL,18,Fhas already melted.
OL,20,FSo was this just a brief taste of the
OL,21,Fseason ahead, or is there more snow on
OL,22,Fthe way?
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
